  "about": "Mix and match ingredients. catalog.js buildCombos crosses every voice with every place, device and motion. Ids are unique across all four lists and never change; names are said aloud as '<voice>, <place>', '<voice> on <device>' and '<voice> <motion>'. Voices stay dry (no room or echo of their own) so every place and motion sits on them cleanly; weather and outdoor places carry their own background bed.",
